WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.033
Text your customers, and pay per message.

2
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:09.950
Type a number and a message, and see the price before you send.

3
00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:12.600
A UK text costs £0.0427.

4
00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:20.550
Replies land in one shared inbox, so anyone on the team can answer them.

5
00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:30.883
From code, one request sends up to 1,000 messages from the same balance.

6
00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:38.883
Every send passes seven checks and one gateway, the only code that calls AWS.

7
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.267
The live site runs a fake carrier.

8
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.400
The worker claims each text before it calls AWS, so a retry never sends it twice.

9
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:53.233
Try it at txtlocal.junaid.guru.
